The Clipper2 library performs intersection, union, difference and
XOR boolean operations on both simple and complex polygons. It also
performs polygon offsetting, and Constrained Delaunay Triangulation.
This is a major update of my original Clipper library that was
written about 15 years ago. That library I'm now calling Clipper1,
and while it still works very well, Clipper2 is just better.
